docs/marketing/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working material kept on disk but out of the published repo.
#
# These are the local agent working material and the internal build record.
# The small, reusable AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md guides are published separately;
# context/ and the notes below remain local because they can go stale.
# A reference copy lives outside the repo; see docs/README.md.
#
# Note: untracking removes them from future commits only. Every commit made
# before this one still carries them, so they remain readable in the history
# of any public clone until that history is rewritten.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
deep-research-report.md
context/
docs/release-readiness-audit.md
docs/plan/
# `docs/dev/*`, not `docs/dev/` — git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so the trailing-slash form would make the negation below dead.
docs/dev/*
!docs/dev/setup.md
